/**
 * CloudSimRunner.java
 * ====================
 * CloudSim Plus digital twin for the Predictive Workload Orchestration project.
 *
 * This Java program:
 * 1. Reads simulation_config.json (generated by Python CloudSimConfig)
 * 2. Creates a realistic CloudSim Plus datacenter with heterogeneous hosts
 * 3. Creates VMs according to scaling actions from the replay log
 * 4. Creates Cloudlets (workload tasks) based on the CPU utilization trace
 * 5. Runs the simulation
 * 6. Collects and writes metrics to cloudsim_metrics.csv
 *
 * Build:
 *   mvn package -f pom.xml
 *   OR
 *   javac -cp cloudsimplus-7.3.0.jar CloudSimRunner.java
 *   jar cf cloudsim_runner.jar CloudSimRunner.class
 *
 * Run:
 *   java -jar cloudsim_runner.jar --config simulation_config.json --output cloudsim_metrics.csv
 *
 * Dependencies:
 *   CloudSim Plus 7.3.0 (https://github.com/manoelcampos/cloudsimplus)
 *   Gson 2.10 (JSON parsing)
 *
 * NOTE: This is a skeleton — import org.cloudsimplus.* requires the JAR on
 * the classpath.  The Python stub in simulation_config.py provides equivalent
 * output when the JAR is not available.
 */

